{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"26":"Knowledge (Kitab Al-Ilm)"},"section_detail":{"26":{"hadithnumber_first":3641,"hadithnumber_last":3668,"arabicnumber_first":3641,"arabicnumber_last":3668,"name_native":"كتاب العلم"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3662,"arabicnumber":3662,"text":"حدثنا ابو بكر بن ابي شيبة، حدثنا علي بن مسهر، عن محمد بن عمرو، عن ابي سلمة، عن ابي هريرة، قال قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم \" حدثوا عن بني اسراييل ولا حرج","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih Lighairihi"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":26,"hadith":22}}]}